RF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. February to March ran 33% of normal in 2025 and 30% in 2026, while May to June came in at 136% in 2026. Grid 22332 had its driest year in 1966 at 50%.</p>"}
